  "note": "Every value is 10240 MB = 10 GiB, and that is not a placeholder. Firefox caps the per-group quota at 10 GB (QuotaManager::GetGroupLimitForLimit, 'cap the group limit to 10GB'), so navigator.storage.estimate().quota returns exactly 10737418240 on any machine with a disk of 100 GiB or more, which is all of them. The 13 values this table used to hold, 40 GiB to 3 TB, were all outside what a real Firefox can report. Measured 2026-08-09 against stock 151: stock 10737418240, ours 429496729600. The rows keep their exact probabilities and positions so the draw structure does not move; the field stays pinnable for a persona on a genuinely small disk, where the real rule is disk/10."
